      <section id="sl-maduruoya" className="sl-slide sl-s-maduruoya sl-c17"><h2 className="sl-c18">{"Maduru Oya Dam"}</h2><div className="sl-c19"><div className="sl-c181"><div className="sl-c182"><p className="sl-c183">{"Built 1979–83 with Canada’s help"}</p></div><div className="sl-c182"><p className="sl-c183">{"The spillway was carved straight into the mountainside"}</p></div><div className="sl-c184"><p className="sl-c183">{"Clearing the site, engineers found an ancient dam and sluice about 2,000 years old, right where the new dam was going"}</p></div></div><div className="sl-c185"><div className="sl-c29"><img className="sl-c186" src="/sl/media/92d51004.webp" alt="The rock-fill dam below a forested rocky hill" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><p className="sl-c31">{"The big dam"}</p></div><div className="sl-c29"><img className="sl-c186" src="/sl/media/6922b904.webp" alt="Water pouring down a spillway cut into the rock face" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><p className="sl-c31">{"Spillway carved into the mountain"}</p></div><div className="sl-c29"><img className="sl-c186" src="/sl/media/e4a40289.webp" alt="The old brick remains of the ancient dam" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><p className="sl-c31">{"The ancient dam"}</p></div><div className="sl-c29"><img className="sl-c187" src="/sl/media/f257e010.webp" alt="A tall white standing Buddha statue on the hillside" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><p className="sl-c31">{"Buddha above the dam"}</p></div></div></div></section>
